  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WBG. New Umbrella Facility for Supporting the Trade Agenda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assisting developing countries in using trade to expand sources of sustainable incomes is essential to reduce poverty and boosting economic growth. Economic integration through trade is central to any development strategy. NOK 6 million of the contribution will be earmarked for the Trade Facilitation Support Programme.</narrative>
  </description>
